---
title: Bianca pizza
servings: 1
yield: 1 pizza
tags: [italian]
cuisine: italian
source: Bianca Pizza by StarChefs, https://www.starchefs.com/recipes/bianca-pizza
---

== White sauce ==

Melt the @butter{} in a #small saucepan{} over medium heat and stir in enough
@flour{} to make a roux. Set it aside.

In a second #saucepan{} over medium heat, soften the @onion{1}(chopped) and
@garlic{2%cloves}(chopped) until translucent.

Pour in the @heavy cream{} and bring to a simmer. Season with @kosher salt{} and
@garlic powder{}, then blend smooth with an #immersion blender{}.

Whisk in the roux and cook over medium heat until thick and smooth. Let it cool.

== Lemon ricotta ==

Stir together the @ricotta{}, the zest of the @lemons{4}, the
@lemon juice{2%fl_oz} and a pinch of @kosher salt{}. Spoon it into a
#piping bag{}.

== Pizza ==

Heat the pizza oven to 800°F.

Stretch the @pizza dough{312%g} on a floured counter into a 12-inch round.
Spread a thin layer of white sauce over it and scatter the
@smoked mozzarella{2%oz}.

Bake until done to your liking, then cut into 6 slices.

Lay a slice of @smoked goat cheese{6%slices} on each piece, add a spoonful of
the lemon ricotta, and finish with @garlic flowers{}.
